Jitsurei process manager
  dispatches a packing command once for a payment event [✔]
  updates the target inline read model when fulfillment dispatches packing [✔]
Jitsurei timers
  claims a due timer and marks it fired [✔]
Jitsurei agent-qualification router
  routes a transaction to every chapter resolved from its areas, idempotently [✔]
Jitsurei incident aggregate
  raises, acknowledges, and rejects a post-acknowledgement escalation [✔]
Jitsurei paging
  sends then acknowledges a page [✔]
  fans IncidentRaised out to one page per rostered responder, idempotently [✔]
Jitsurei escalation process manager
  advances the saga and schedules an escalation timer on IncidentRaised [✔]
  dispatches AcknowledgeIncident on PageAcknowledged, idempotently [✔]
  escalates an unacknowledged incident when the timer fires [✔]
  is a benign no-op when the incident was already acknowledged [✔]
Jitsurei shipment notices
  maps OrderShipped to a notice and ignores every other order event [✔]
  drains an enqueued notice into the notices table, idempotently [✔]
  dead-letters a notice that can never be sent [✔]
  preserves per-order order and drains every grouped notice [✔]

